    <briefdescription>
<para>Фасад модуля розпізнавання — координує <ref refid="class_hand_tracker" kindref="compound">HandTracker</ref> і <ref refid="class_gesture_classifier" kindref="compound">GestureClassifier</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_gesture_recognizer" kindref="compound">GestureRecognizer</ref> є <bold>єдиною публічною точкою входу</bold> до підсистеми CV. <ref refid="class_application" kindref="compound">Application</ref> взаємодіє лише з цим класом, не знаючи деталей реалізації <ref refid="class_hand_tracker" kindref="compound">HandTracker</ref> або <ref refid="class_gesture_classifier" kindref="compound">GestureClassifier</ref>.</para>
<sect1 id="class_gesture_recognizer_1autotoc_md5_1s1"><sect2 id="class_gesture_recognizer_1autotoc_md5_1s2"><sect3 id="class_gesture_recognizer_1autotoc_md5">
<title>Патерн Facade</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Application</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>│</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>└──►<sp/><ref refid="class_gesture_recognizer_1ab05de270df0863d4dc17b9ef7e4c8059" kindref="member">GestureRecognizer::process</ref>(frame)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>├──►<sp/><ref refid="class_hand_tracker_1a07291d23230fc13c10d3b9a06e9f3fe6" kindref="member">HandTracker::detect</ref>(frame)<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>→<sp/>HandData</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>└──►<sp/><ref refid="class_gesture_classifier_1a736bec72c73f01bf562c303fd21f0756" kindref="member">GestureClassifier::classify</ref>(hand)<sp/>→<sp/>GestureResult</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect3></sect2></sect1>
